  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_94dedcc5-5102-46e6-a406-b42e318d6dc8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"555\" height=\"54\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">✧ 織物與飾品 ✧</h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">此模組旨在添加可用於多種建築風格的方塊與家具！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_362b1e9d-9e08-48b8-9744-8653ad58ba50.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"555\" height=\"54\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1303639/description_1490d528-86c7-47e9-a3b1-376cbc5d751b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"455\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_362b1e9d-9e08-48b8-9744-8653ad58ba50.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"555\" height=\"54\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b404b807-f41e-4eab-9998-e4341ac1bbf6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"353\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_30849bb2-50aa-4c66-8341-b72da8d9b817.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"353\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1d8f235b-59e6-447d-8282-9b9cda0c2745.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"353\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">所有方塊皆可使用精華與切石機合成，強烈建議搭配 JEI 使用。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>未來將持續新增更多方塊！ :]</em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/WFQC22jhnA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>點此加入 Discord 社群</em></a></strong></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">- 需搭配 GECKOLIB 使用 -</h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6d02d0b0-be2a-4ebc-b985-5ab8591054a8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"555\" height=\"54\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
